\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 4. Architecture Review\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The high-level monorepo boundary is good, and the modular monolith is appropriate at this stage. Core services such as the stock ledger, posting engine, number-series service, tax engine, and approval engine are the right architectural direction.\
The execution is inconsistent:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Route modules contain both transport and substantial domain logic; several are 600\'961,100 lines long.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\fs26 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 any
\f1\fs24  is used in generic route helpers, weakening Drizzle/TypeScript protections.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Tenant context is not enforced as a repository-wide invariant.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 PostgreSQL is the sole durability and scale boundary; this is fine initially, but no load, recovery, or multi-node evidence exists.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Scalability inference:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 10\'96100 users: plausible after critical security and workflow fixes.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1,000 users: uncertain; connection pool is fixed at 10 and no load tests, queue/outbox, caching strategy validation, or SLOs are present.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 10,000/enterprise: not credible yet, chiefly due to isolation, auditability, testing, and operations gaps\'97not because a monolith is inherently wrong.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

