\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The manual journal voucher page calls an unregistered API path.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The production e-invoice client is a skeleton; mock IRP is the default, and production functions throw ([irp-client.ts (line 128)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/services/irp-client.ts:128)).\
