\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 11. Risks\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Critical \'97 cross-tenant data loss and financial corruption.
\f1\b0  Inventory approval fetches an adjustment by ID, then posts stock and GL using the caller\'92s company ID ([inventory.ts (line 266)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/routes/inventory.ts:266)). This can mix a foreign document\'92s warehouse/lines with the caller\'92s ledger context.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Critical \'97 privilege escalation via settings and masters.
\f1\b0  These routes only require authentication; company ID is URL-controlled and individual records are often updated by ID alone ([masters.ts (line 38)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/routes/masters.ts:38), [settings.ts (line 81)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/routes/settings.ts:81)).\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High \'97 known platform-admin credential.
\f1\b0  The README and seed contain a fixed system-admin email/password and precomputed hash ([README.md (line 76)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/README.md:76), [system-admin.ts (line 29)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/packages/db/src/seeds/system-admin.ts:29)).\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High \'97 approval integrity.
\f1\b0  Approval actions have no uniqueness constraint by request, level, and approver; one person can potentially satisfy an N-of-M level with repeated approvals ([approvals.ts (line 91)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/packages/db/src/schema/approvals.ts:91), [approval-engine.ts (line 141)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/services/approval-engine.ts:141)).\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High \'97 unprotected approval lifecycle endpoints.
\f1\b0  Approval start/list/detail/action endpoints lack normal permission checks, and detail lookup is unscoped by company ([governance.ts (line 127)](/Users/shyam18/SEGA/ERP/apps/api/src/routes/governance.ts:127)).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

